{"title":"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_(Last_resort)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 (Last resort)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_5_(Formula)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5 (Formula)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/e/3de42ac9f00a49db557f56672d137491ae9f3bfc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(625^{\\log_5 2015})^{\\frac{1}{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"22\" />&#160;?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/2/9123c6861615bbff4b77a8e0d9774474701447a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\; 5 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\; \\sqrt[4]{2015} \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\; 625 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\; 2015 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\; \\sqrt[4]{5^{2015}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"478\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/a/95aad13354e89127b2e301611b92e32f417fc077.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(625^{\\log_5 2015})^\\frac{1}{4}=((5^4)^{\\log_5 2015})^\\frac{1}{4}=(5^{4 \\cdot \\log_5 2015})^\\frac{1}{4}=(5^{\\log_5 2015 \\cdot 4})^\\frac{1}{4}=((5^{\\log_5 2015})^4)^\\frac{1}{4}=(2015^4)^\\frac{1}{4}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\; 2015}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"815\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can rewrite <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/f/0af98ec58f2842c8c63286efedff7a660f09ac8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_5 2015$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"17\" /> as as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/d/81dac0f07d9f38db1fc714ad3113c0840dafda4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^x = 2015$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"77\" height=\"13\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/2/0f2c9fc4fa447a202904998b67951c2c01506905.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$625^{x \\cdot \\frac{1}{4}} = 5^x = \\boxed{2015}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"166\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/c/d0cce6fd0eb408a5226c77f8ae2c05d1c6056ab4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(625^{\\log_5 2015})^{\\frac{1}{4}} = (625^{\\frac{1}{4}})^{\\log_5 2015} = 5^{\\log_5 2015} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}~2015}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"430\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~ <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Cxsmi\">cxsmi</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4_.28Last_resort.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(Last_resort)\">Solution 4 (Last resort)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (Last resort)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We note that the year number is just <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/c/b7c41d5d55f66cd4a292a064c28c0c679742c8a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2015$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" />, so just guess <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/a/0babc3e8702dced37772fee2d65a9dc600fc17b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)} 2015}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"79\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~xHypotenuse\n</p><p>Easily the best solution\n(yeah definetly)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/RdIIEhsbZKw?t=738\">https://youtu.be/RdIIEhsbZKw?t=738</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_5_.28Formula.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5_(Formula)\">Solution 5 (Formula)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5 (Formula)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/9/f99e6251672ed55a5eccb24b940db2ef83be7c31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{\\log_b c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"17\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/6/8a68cfe9462dd2102323dbcba0ddb3735ae7b0ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c^{\\log_b a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" />. Using this, the problem is trivial, giving us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/a/a9afb1cc9dd3c11dc83110365657172310edf18d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2015^{\\log_5 625})^\\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"109\" height=\"24\" /> or simply <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/d/0dd2da9ded1b2403f91b3c01d7c6775bb6a22188.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2015^{4})^\\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"70\" height=\"24\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/a/0babc3e8702dced37772fee2d65a9dc600fc17b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)} 2015}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"79\" height=\"30\" />.\\\\\n</p><p>~letsfunction\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B\">2015 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b